<urn:atm:triage:finding/RSH-X3-004>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "RSH-X3-004" ;
  triage:title "Blocking SQLite I/O in DaemonRequestDispatcher::new constructor" ;
  triage:description "crates/atm-daemon/src/runtime_health.rs:208 — constructor performs synchronous SQLite I/O inline via build_runtime_status_cache_state(). I/O belongs in an async-safe initializer, not a constructor." ;
